  "<p>Validates a single domain string. Returns <code>{ ok, issues }</code>. Issue kinds: <code>bad-input</code>, <code>empty</code>, <code>domain-cap</code>, <code>label-cap</code>, <code>empty-label</code>, <code>ldh-violation</code>, <code>double-hyphen</code>, <code>underscore-label</code>, <code>underscore-malformed</code>, <code>punycode-bare</code>, <code>punycode-label</code>, <code>raw-unicode-label</code>, <code>mixed-script</code>, <code>special-use</code>, <code>ipv4-as-domain</code>, <code>ipv6-literal</code>, <code>single-label</code>, <code>wildcard</code>, <code>trailing-dot</code>, <code>dga-entropy</code>, <code>bidi-override</code>, <code>null-byte</code>, <code>control-char</code>, <code>zero-width</code>.</p>",
  "<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">b.guardDomain.validate(\"example.com\", { profile: \"strict\" });",
  "// → { ok: true, issues: [] }",
