  "<h2 id=\"email-validate\">b.guardEmail.validate(input, options) <a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#email-validate\">#</a></h2>",
  "<p><code>b.guardEmail.validate</code> auto-detects whether the input is a single address or a full message and applies the email guard threat catalog accordingly. Use it before accepting recipients, reply-to values, imported address lists, or raw mail snippets.</p>",
  "<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">var result = b.guardEmail.validate(\"alice@example.com\", { profile: \"strict\" });",
  "typeof result.ok; // \"boolean\"</code></pre>",
  "<h2 id=\"email-sanitize\">b.guardEmail.sanitize(input, options) <a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#email-sanitize\">#</a></h2>",
  "<p><code>b.guardEmail.sanitize</code> returns a normalized string only when the selected profile can safely repair the input. It throws on unrecoverable SMTP-smuggling, header-injection, and spoofing issues.</p>",
  "<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">var address = b.guardEmail.sanitize(\"alice@example.com\", { profile: \"strict\" });",
  "address; // \"alice@example.com\"</code></pre>",
